CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION prov_updateappealinfo(appealobj json)
 RETURNS text
 LANGUAGE plpgsql
AS $function$                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
declare                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
 v_securityuserid character varying; 
v_status character varying;
v_provider_decision character varying;
 begin                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 

v_securityuserid := appealobj->>'securityuserid';
v_status=appealobj->>'status';
v_provider_decision=appealobj->>'appeal_provider_decision';
if (v_provider_decision==='Overturn') then
 update tb_prov_cpa_address set dateappeal_meeting=(appealobj->>'dateappeal_meeting')::timestamp ,status='' ,appeal_provider_decision=(appealobj->>'appeal_provider_decision') where provider_cpa_address_id=(appealobj->>'provider_cpa_address_id')::uuid;
else
 update tb_prov_cpa_address set dateappeal_meeting=(appealobj->>'dateappeal_meeting')::timestamp ,status=v_status ,appeal_provider_decision=(appealobj->>'appeal_provider_decision') where provider_cpa_address_id=(appealobj->>'provider_cpa_address_id')::uuid;
    end if;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
return 'success';  
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
end;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
$function$

